/span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span> (formal system, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}\\)</span> (elementary-system predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Ax}(\\mathcal F))\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Ax}(\\mathcal F))\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (axiom-code set)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}implies\\text{-}recursive}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Elem}(\\mathcal F)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Dec}\\bigl(\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Ax}(\\mathcal F))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}implies\\text{-}recursive}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Elem}(\\mathcal F)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Dec}\\bigl(\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Ax}(\\mathcal F))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}(\\mathcal{F})\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}(\\mathcal{F})\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span>是初等系统</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}\\bigl(\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Ax}(\\mathcal F))\\bigr)\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec}\\bigl(\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Ax}(\\mathcal F))\\bigr)\\)</span> : 公理码集可判定</li>\n<li>初等性定义直接给出公理码集的递归特征函数</li>\n<li>因而结论是外部的可判定性，不是从“可表示”反推可判定性</li>\n<li>这是Smullyan框架与标准框架的对齐</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formal-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-elementary-system","status":"resolved","id":"360e00ddf38f0f16","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-elementary-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"b090f61b9f3ec664","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-axiom-set","status":"resolved","id":"35c764f4e9f21f28","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-axiom-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{F}$ (formal system, see [[92-df-formal-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-elementary-system","status":"resolved","id":"360e00ddf38f0f16","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Elem}$ (elementary-system predicate, see [[92-df-elementary-system]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Elem}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Ax}(\\mathcal F))\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}elementary\